# The repository currently has one collaborator, who is also the author of the RNL-001 PR.
# GitHub's "require review from code owners" cannot be enabled without a second reviewer
# (self-approval is not allowed), so this file declares ownership and routes review without
# making the author's own PR unmergeable. The required status checks on `main` are enforced
# independently (see tools/architecture-policy.json and docs/architecture-ownership.md).

